/h2>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"5444\" data-end=\"5478\">Q1. Is ProZenith FDA-approved?</h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"5479\" data-end=\"5600\">No dietary supplements are FDA-approved, but ProZenith is made in an FDA-registered facility with GMP guidelines.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"5602\" data-end=\"5633\">Q2. Who can take ProZenith?</h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"5634\" data-end=\"5733\">Adults over 18 who want to lose weight naturally. Not suitable for pregnant or breastfeeding women.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"5735\" data-end=\"5773\">Q3. How long does it take to work?</h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"5774\" data-end=\"5864\">Most users start seeing results within 2–4 weeks, with best results in 2–3 months.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"5866\" data-end=\"5908\">Q4. Do I need to follow a strict diet?</h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"5909\" data-end=\"5977\">No, but for faster results, it helps to eat healthy and stay active.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"5979\" data-end=\"6011\">Q5. What if it doesn’t work?</h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"6012\" data-end=\"6095\">You can return the product within <strong data-start=\"6046\" data-end=\"6057\">60 days</strong> for a full refund—no questions asked.</p>\n<hr class=\"\" data-start=\"6097\" data-end=\"6100\" />\n<h2 class=\"\" data-start=\"6102\" data-end=\"6144\">🧠 Tips to Boost Results with ProZenith</h2>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"6146\" data-end=\"6215\">For the best results while using ProZenith, follow these simple tips:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"6217\" data-end=\"6443\">\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"6217\" data-end=\"6262\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"6219\" data-end=\"6262\">Drink at least 8 glasses of water daily</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"6263\" data-end=\"6304\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"6265\" data-end=\"6304\">Avoid sugary drinks and processed foods</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"6305\" data-end=\"6358\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"6307\" data-end=\"6358\">